---
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
---

<Header />

<main>

  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About Compassion Bridge Initiative Uganda</h1>
      <p>
        Restoring dignity, building futures through compassion, education,
        empowerment and sustainable community development.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">

      <h2>Who We Are</h2>

      <p>
        Compassion Bridge Initiative Uganda is a community-based organisation
        committed to improving the quality of life of vulnerable children,
        families and communities in Uganda, with a special focus on
        underserved communities in Kamuli District, Eastern Uganda.
      </p>

      <p>
        We work to create opportunities for vulnerable people through
        education support, health promotion, vocational skills development,
        livelihood empowerment, child protection, psychosocial support and
        sustainable community development initiatives.
      </p>

      <p>
        We believe that every person deserves dignity, hope and the opportunity
        to reach their full potential.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="cards-section">

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Our Vision</h2>
      <p>
        A compassionate, empowered and resilient society where every person
        lives with dignity, opportunity, hope and the ability to realise their
        full potential.
      </p>
    </div>


    <div class="card">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        To improve the quality of life of vulnerable populations through
        compassionate action, education, health promotion, livelihoods support,
        vocational skills development, child protection, disability inclusion,
        disaster response and sustainable community development.
      </p>
    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="values-section">

    <div class="container">

      <h2>Our Core Values</h2>

      <div class="values-grid">

        <div>Compassion</div>
        <div>Integrity</div>
        <div>Accountability</div>
        <div>Stewardship</div>
        <div>Respect</div>
        <div>Excellence</div>
        <div>Collaboration</div>
        <div>Service</div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="story-section">

    <div class="container">

      <h2>Our Story</h2>

      <p>
        Compassion Bridge Initiative Uganda was born from a deep commitment
        to stand with vulnerable people and communities facing poverty,
        limited opportunities and social challenges.
      </p>

      <p>
        Through working closely with communities, we have seen the power of
        compassion, education and empowerment in transforming lives. Our goal
        is not only to provide immediate support, but also to help individuals
        and families build resilience and create sustainable futures.
      </p>

      <p>
        Together with community members, partners and supporters, we are
        building bridges of hope and opportunity.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


</main>


<style>

.about-hero {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b4f8a, #1b7a6e);
  color: white;
  padding: 70px 20px;
  text-align: center;
}

.about-hero h1 {
  font-size: 42px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.about-hero p {
  font-size: 20px;
  max-width: 750px;
  margin: auto;
}


.container {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 40px 20px;
}


.about-section h2,
.values-section h2,
.story-section h2 {
  color: #0b4f8a;
  font-size: 32px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}


.about-section p,
.story-section p,
.card p {
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: #444;
}


.cards-section {
  display: flex;
  gap: 30px;
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 30px 20px;
}


.card {
  flex: 1;
  background: #f5f8fa;
  padding: 30px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}


.values-section {
  background: #fafafa;
}


.values-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}


.values-grid div {
  background: white;
  padding: 20px;
  text-align: center;
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #0b4f8a;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}


.story-section {
  padding-bottom: 60px;
}



@media(max-width: 768px){

.about-hero h1 {
  font-size: 30px;
}


.cards-section {
  flex-direction: column;
}


.values-grid {
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
}

}


@media(max-width: 450px){

.values-grid {
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
}

}

</style>